							"emotion": "sad",
							"type": "speech",
							"content": {
								"korean": "비르다는… 라그나로크를 막으려던 예언자였어. 우리를 보호하려 했던 거야!",
								"english": "Virda… was a prophet trying to prevent Ragnarok. She was trying to protect us!",
